<title>UK: Ashanti 12-month earnings fall 33 pct.</title>
<headline>Ashanti 12-month earnings fall 33 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to September 30</p>
<p>			   (million U.S. dollars unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		0.79		   vs 1.22</p>
<p> Earnings		   70.9		   vs 105.9</p>
<p> Pretax		     71.4		   vs 106.2</p>
<p> Turnover		   442.1		  vs 387.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast earenings after tax and after minorities between $75 and $86 million. Ashanti is changing its financial year to coincide with the calendar year. It therefore intends to pay a final dividend for the 15-month period to Dec 31 at the end of April 1997.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
